                <li>[March 2026] My paper "<a href="https://openreview.net/forum?id=Jij7zCjVfc" target="_blank">Transformers in the Dark: Navigating Unknown Search Spaces via Bandit Feedback</a>" has been awarded a <a href="https://jmlr.org/tmlr/editorial-policies.html#certifications" target="_blank">J2C Certification</a>.</li>
